Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Infiltration
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 54
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.23,0:00:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, are you nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.15,0:00:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,With you by my side, I’m not nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.03,0:00:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, Wolnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.06,0:00:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll be keeping an eye on this restoration device for Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.42,0:00:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, it was developed by Mr. Slowy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.58,0:00:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,so it’s sure to be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.66,0:00:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need to input a bit more data,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.14,0:00:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and then we can start your restoration, Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.03,0:00:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the real-time feed from the drone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.39,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected that Blue would obtain the Absorption Device
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.84,0:00:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and not use it to save the original world,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.95,0:00:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,but rather to establish a so-called “new world”.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.19,0:00:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How could this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.83,0:00:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this his method of saving the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.67,0:00:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is just a patchwork creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.40,0:01:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How is this any different from a bandit?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.60,0:01:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Before he absorbs all the energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.40,0:01:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,we need to take action immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.28,0:01:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, what can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.96,0:01:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Based on the footage captured by the drones earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,the core device has already been integrated into Blue’s world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.44,0:01:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And now we can see
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,that a lot of energy from his world is merging into this energy shield
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.40,0:01:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,so by following this energy, we can definitely find the Absorption Device
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.97,0:01:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But what does that have to do with saving Weslie?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.49,0:01:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If Weslie was sucked in while wearing the Energization Prevention Device
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.64,0:01:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,then as long as we follow this energy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.32,0:01:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,we’re bound to run into him
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.89,0:01:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.65,0:01:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,it looks like this energy shield
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.25,0:01:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,isn’t something you can just enter easily
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.57,0:01:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re smart
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.60,0:01:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You grasped the key point right away
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.24,0:01:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like anyone named Sparky is pretty smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.81,0:01:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn’t seem to have anything to do with you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.08,0:02:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This energy shield seems to exist to protect his world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.84,0:02:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If we want to get in,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.96,0:02:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,we’ll have to blast a small opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.84,0:02:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to this spot here;
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.84,0:02:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,it’s the shortest route.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.96,0:02:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.11,0:02:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we know the mission, it’s simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.79,0:02:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s move out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.07,0:02:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.60,0:02:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue is so cautious;
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.60,0:02:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,he’s bound to have guards posted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, that’s what I was thinking too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.39,0:02:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.59,0:02:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I suggest we split into two groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.39,0:02:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,One group goes in first
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.76,0:02:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,to draw the enemy away
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.00,0:02:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and open a passage in the energy shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.75,0:02:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The other group waits for the shield to open
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.15,0:02:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,then rushes inside
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.63,0:02:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,to join Weslie in destroying the device.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.19,0:02:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie usually handles this kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.20,0:02:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought it would be my turn—Sparky’s turn—today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.55,0:02:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said, he isn’t you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.43,0:02:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds like a good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.99,0:02:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But let’s try to operate covertly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.72,0:02:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll act as the vanguard, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.20,0:02:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.60,0:02:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll go too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.88,0:03:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Safety first, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.36,0:03:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the security here to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.44,0:03:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.36,0:03:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I’ve restored,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.28,0:03:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll come help you right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.07,0:03:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did Mr. Slowy only have the drones drop us off here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.78,0:03:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There are very few drones left.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.82,0:03:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy is saving them for the next assault team.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.29,0:03:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as we break the energy shield,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.25,0:03:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie and the others will storm inside at top speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.01,0:03:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.37,0:03:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns out anyone named Sparky is really smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.01,0:03:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many residents here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.41,0:03:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If they spot us, they might tell Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.41,0:03:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.46,0:03:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Stick close to me, Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.85,0:04:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Thorn Forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.49,0:04:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He really can piece anything together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.89,0:04:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.82,0:04:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll help too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.21,0:04:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are these thorns so hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.41,0:04:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s metal from the Blue Planet world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.65,0:04:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a bit troublesome when elements from different worlds are mixed together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.56,0:04:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only way to the energy shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.60,0:04:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t take a detour.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.85,0:04:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Come take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.01,0:04:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There are some parts here that aren’t made of metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.85,0:04:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s attack this spot together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.60,0:04:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can handle this myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.60,0:05:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were just a bit smart,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.64,0:05:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but I didn’t expect your abilities to be this impressive, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.64,0:05:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hang in there a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.36,0:05:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like Blue didn’t even post any guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.36,0:05:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s not that smart after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.68,0:05:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.08,0:05:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.40,0:05:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Brown, weren’t you…by Blue…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.16,0:06:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Brown, it’s me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.20,0:06:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s Sparky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.76,0:06:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.20,0:06:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.48,0:06:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He isn’t our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.44,0:06:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that he’s attacking you without holding back
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.24,0:06:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,only proves that right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.00,0:06:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,he’s being controlled by Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.21,0:06:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can’t beat him, can’t we at least dodge him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.40,0:06:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Brown is under Blue’s control.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.60,0:07:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We’d better be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.04,0:07:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s make a run for the energy shield while we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.43,0:07:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s no use hiding anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.60,0:07:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.59,0:07:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you standing there for? Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.03,0:07:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a good thing we’ve been to Blue Planet World before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.23,0:07:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The roads are pretty much the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.41,0:07:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We should have shaken him off by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.20,0:07:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,With my driving skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.20,0:07:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,you can rest easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t even think about getting close to that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.55,0:08:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll hold him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.55,0:08:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, look for a chance to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.11,0:08:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.16,0:08:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.16,0:08:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re out of time—go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.64,0:08:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Today…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.08,0:08:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,None of you can leave this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.21,0:08:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t forget about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.36,0:08:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t hold on much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.00,0:08:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.08,0:08:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.11,0:08:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.04,0:08:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.76,0:08:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand; I will definitely complete the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.69,0:08:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.84,0:09:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.99,0:09:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost at the energy shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.88,0:09:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you’re going?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.24,0:09:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Green, you’ve been controlled by Blue too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.83,0:09:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,A cheap trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.99,0:09:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.88,0:09:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t waste your energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.00,0:10:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.88,0:10:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.20,0:10:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My world is still waiting for me to save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.60,0:10:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You can even fuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.23,0:10:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think that’ll work?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.36,0:10:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I’d run into a challenging opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.64,0:10:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t expect you to be this weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.96,0:10:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re not even a proper warm-up for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.68,0:10:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you really are being controlled.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.79,0:10:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The Green I know…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.83,0:10:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,wouldn’t say things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.61,0:10:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.21,0:10:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,you’re not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.81,0:10:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,To even make it this far,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.01,0:10:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve had to rely on Sparky and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.44,0:10:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But they’re all saving the world in their own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.41,0:11:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie is still in there, waiting for us to rescue him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.09,0:11:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.58,0:11:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are there still more?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.82,0:11:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how powerful you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.02,0:11:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll fight to the end in my own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.98,0:11:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Pulling a cheap trick like that…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.81,0:11:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.30,0:11:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.46,0:11:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I need to lure him away
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.30,0:11:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,so Tibbie and Jonie can get inside safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.42,0:11:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to call my friends over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.42,0:11:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m running!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.82,0:11:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t run!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.85,0:11:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie, Jonie—it’s up to you guys now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.01,0:12:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky and the others succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.58,0:12:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s time for us to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.50,0:12:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, kids.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
